Subject: [PATCH 13/24] fix(payment): handle Paymob SDK cancellation and
 failure states

- Map PaymobSdkListener status to CheckoutViewModel state

- Prevent success receipt from showing on cancelled or failed transactions

- Expose Cancelled state via PaymentResult back to calling module

- Intercept system back button to trigger Cancelled state
---
